messages:  [["Please act as a math teacher and solve the addition problem in the given template.\n####\n# Question:\nWhat is the sum of <<number1>> and <<number2>>?\n# Reasoning:\nLet's add the two numbers digit by digit.\n1. The ones place: <<digit1>>\n2. The tens place: <<digit2>>\n<<other digits>>\nAnswer:\nTherefore, the final computed sum is <<answer>>.\n####\n# Question:\nWhat is the sum of 152158 and 276741?\n# Reasoning:", '<think>\nI need to figure out what is the sum of 152158 and 276741. First, I will align the two numbers by their place values to ensure accurate addition.\n\nNext, I will add the digits starting from the rightmost digit (the ones place) and move to the left.\n\nIf the sum of any two digits exceeds 9, I will carry over the extra value to the next higher place value.\n\nI will continue this process for each place value until all digits have been added.\n\nFinally, I will compile the results to obtain the final sum.\n. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is ']]
